<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="2"><head>47.</head><lb/>
<bibl>Un&#x017F;ers Herren Je&#x017F;u Chri&#x017F;ti Kinderbuch; oder<lb/>
merkwu&#x0364;rdige, hi&#x017F;tori&#x017F;che Be&#x017F;chreibung von<lb/>
<pb n="251" facs="#f0269"/>
